 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "während, bis and bevor",
     "texto": [
      "**Während** means \"while\" and expresses that two things happen at the same time: **Während ich arbeite, höre ich Musik** (while I work, I listen to music). **Bis** means \"until\": **Ich arbeite, bis ich müde bin** (I work until I'm tired). **Bevor** means \"before\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Watch out for the false friend",
     "texto": [
      "**bis** doesn't mean \"yes\" or \"well\". It means \"until\". **Während** with a noun (without a verb) means \"during\": **während des Tages** (during the day). We'll see that in chapter 27."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
